{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "86667630-468c-870c-9028-bb1363dc2892",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:09:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:02:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes. My name is Ana Souza. I am calling about the water in the street. It is, um, it is over the curb again and nobody has come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. Where is this, Ms. Souza?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three, four, four. Malbone Road. In the North End. I am the landlord, I own the house, and the tenants called me this morning because they cannot even go out the front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three forty-four Malbone Road. Got it. And you said again, so this has happened before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, every time we have a big rain, the same thing. The water comes up out of the road and sits. I have told the city before. It keeps happening, and nothing changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And this is after the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, Friday and Saturday. Two days ago it ended. And it is Monday now and the water is still there. Not as high, but over the curb and all across the sidewalk. You cannot walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, still sitting there two days later. So it's not draining at all. Is it up in the yard or the house, or just street and sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street and the sidewalk. The yard is wet, but the house is okay, thank God. But this morning a delivery truck, a big one, he tried to go through and he got stuck. Right in the water. They had to call somebody to pull him out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Was anybody hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. The man was fine, only angry. He was, um, he said some words. But he left, finally. And the water is still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:01-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Let me write this down. Three forty-four Malbone, water over the curb and across the sidewalk since the storm, delivery truck stuck this morning. Do you know if there's a storm drain right there, a grate you can see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there is one at the corner, near the, um, near the telephone pole. I think it is full of leaves. And dirt. I cannot tell. The water is too deep to see it good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. Leaves and debris are a common reason. I'll note it's likely clogged or blocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I took photographs. Many photographs. This morning, with my phone. The street, the sidewalk, the truck. I can send them to you if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be great. Do you have an email you can send them to, or are they better to hand to the crew when they come out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not do the email so good. My daughter does that. I can have her send them. Tell me where."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me check what the best way is. Hold on one second, okay? I'm going to pull up the work order form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. So, I'll put it in the request that photos are available, and the crew supervisor can contact you for them. That work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is fine. Excuse me, I am sorry if I am slow. I have sawdust on my sleeves, I was in the workshop. I do woodworking in the garage and I came in quick when the tenant called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. Take your time. So, can I get a good callback number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four, zero, one. [pause] Five, five, five. [pause] zero, one, nine, six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-six. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And it's Ana Souza, S-O-U-Z-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Souza. With a Z."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kevin, I want to ask. Who do I call to get this checked? Because I called before and nobody told me who. I do not want to call and call. Somebody has to look at the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. You've got the right place, it's Public Works, we handle the storm drains. I'm putting in the request now so a crew can go look at that drain and the road. If you don't hear back in a couple of days, call this department again and give them the address and say there's a request already open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of days. [pause] The water is there now. With the truck and everything. People walking in the street, they could get hit by a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll mark it as a safety issue, since the sidewalk is blocked and the truck got stuck. That helps it get looked at sooner. Crews are stretched after a storm like this, but I'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:08:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope so. Because every storm I say the same thing. It is not the first time. I am tired of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I've got it noted that it's a repeat location. Is there anything else going on, like water getting toward the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not yet. If it comes to the house I will call right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. Okay, you're all set with the request. Someone from the department should call you at that number, and your daughter can send those photos when they do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. I hope somebody comes today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do what I can on my end. Take care, Ms. Souza."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:09:48-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
